<p><b>The manual, redesigned.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Help → Asobi Manual reads like a book now: designed chapter openings, a proper type scale, keycap chips in the shortcut tables, callout cards, and <b>figures</b> — real screenshots of the viewer, aspect guides, compare wipes, the grade panel, scopes and the filmstrip, captured from a working review.</li>
