<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 394)</h2>
<p><b>Aspect ratio guides, and your pipeline's status readable in the viewer.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Aspect Guides</b> (eye menu): framing standards drawn over the picture — 2.39:1 Scope, 2.00:1 Univisium, 1.85:1 Flat, 16:9, 4:3, and the social crops 9:16, 4:5, 1:1. Turn on several at once; each is labeled, stays glued to the image through pan and zoom, and never appears in exports.</li>
<li><b>Pipeline status</b> (eye menu): the <code>hud_tokens</code> plugin's lines — tracker status, due dates, whatever your pipeline stamps on exports — now show live under the viewer readouts, refreshed as you change clips.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
